    "/v1/applications": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Submit an application and receive a pre-decision",
        "tags": [
          "applications"
        ],
        "description": "Synchronous: validate, screen, look the applicant up at the bureau, decide, persist, answer.\n\n`Idempotency-Key` is optional but strongly recommended. Without one, a retry after a network\ntimeout creates a second application — it will NOT create a second bureau enquiry, which is\nprevented separately, but it will create a second record. With one, an identical retry returns\nthe stored response byte for byte and carries `Idempotency-Replayed: true`.\n\n`preDecision.reasonCodes` may be an empty array. That is correct and happens for exactly one\ncase: an approval on the terms applied for, which is not adverse action and owes the applicant\nno explanation. Read `length === 0` rather than treating the field as absent.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitApplicationInput"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 200
            },
            "in": "header",
            "name": "idempotency-key",
            "required": false
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Submission"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/applications/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Read an application and its composed outcome",
        "tags": [
          "applications"
        ],
        "description": "The reason a synchronous API still needs a status call: `MANUAL_REVIEW` is not terminal.\n\n`preDecision` never changes — it is what the engine concluded, and a human disagreeing with it\ndoes not make it untrue. `outcome` is the composed answer and is the only field that moves.\n\nReads are owner-scoped. An unknown id and another client's id return the same 404 body:\ndistinguishing them would turn this endpoint into an oracle confirming which ids are real.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"
            },
            "in": "path",
            "name": "id",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApplicationStatus"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/reviews/{applicationId}/close": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Record the outcome of a manual review",
        "tags": [
          "reviews"
        ],
        "description": "Records what a PERSON concluded, on criteria this service does not model. It is not a review\nworkflow: no queue, no assignment, no SLA, no UI.\n\n`reviewerId` comes from the bearer token and never from the body — a human verdict with no\nattributable actor cannot answer \"could anyone have altered a verdict after the fact?\", and\nletting the caller name themselves is the same hole with extra steps.\n\nThe write is conditional on the review still being PENDING, so two concurrent closes produce\none write and one 409. A closed review is never reopened; a mistaken outcome is a new application.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CloseReviewInput"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"
            },
            "in": "path",
            "name": "applicationId",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApplicationStatus"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Default Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/audit/applications/{id}/events": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "The append-only event trail for one application",
        "tags": [
          "audit"
        ],
        "description": "Index 2 is named BUREAU_REPORT_ATTACHED rather than STORED because on the reuse path nothing is written. An audit trail that records a write which did not happen is one nobody can rely on.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"
            },
